    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢【</span><strong><span>神气小鹿】</span></strong><span>对本期节目的大力支持。</span></p><p><span>点击进入专属购买链接：</span><a href="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/37909492?shop_id=498131482" data-url="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/37909492?shop_id=498131482"><u><span>mo.m.tmall.com</span></u></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkERq2EFCo6gF9DOAqYKt5YyS0Wj.jpg"><p><span>● 来自香港的一桩错综复杂的案件</span></p><p><span>● 每个人的证词都不一样 究竟她是怎么死的</span></p><p><span>● 余叔韶智取信息漏洞 破解案件关键</span></p><p><span>⭐</span></p><p><span>养好自己的第一步，先从睡眠养起来！姐妹们，马上入秋了，秋冬正是我们需要更多睡眠的时候，可以计划为自己的睡眠考虑考虑了。这次带来的【</span><strong><span>神气小鹿双面承托护颈枕】</span></strong><span>就是个不错的选择，再也不用忧愁自己失眠了~</span></p><p><span>像我这种睡前有玩手机的习惯，每次玩手机玩过头，脖颈出就特别的不舒服，之后怎么换睡姿都睡不着了。但这次我有了神气小鹿的帮助，无论什么姿势玩手机，玩完之后都还你一个精致睡眠！</span></p><p><strong><em><span>为什么会安利神气小鹿呢？</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.慢回弹，改善你和床品之间的亲密关系</span></strong></p><p><span>我之前买的都是回弹性特别强的枕头，尤其我喜欢那种蓬松的大枕头，每次睡觉感觉头部底下在驯服一只猛兽，睡久了好累。但这下真的让我知道慢回弹是有多香了，</span></p><p><span>躺下去稳稳被接纳住的感觉，终于摆脱和枕头之间的敌对关系。</span></p><p><strong><span>2. 多功能分区，你的睡姿和矫情都被分配的明明白白</span></strong></p><p><span>时代在进步，科学带来的好处也直接影响了你的睡眠：头部承托区，侧睡缓冲区，颈椎减压区，肩颈保护区...一套组合拳把你服侍得服服帖帖。无论平躺着睡还是侧着睡，都不影响你的舒适度，在做到极致保护的同时又给予你最舒适的呵护。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.完美高度，打造脖颈与枕身的最佳cp</span></strong></p><p><span>高枕前高11cm，后高9cm，无论你脖子多长，都给你稳稳拖住。</span></p><p><span>低枕前高8cm，后高6cm，无论你是海绵宝宝还是蜡笔小新，一样能枕出洋洋得意。</span></p><p><strong><span>4.亲肤枕套，皮肤的福利局</span></strong></p><p><span>亲肤材质，透气不染尘，像睡在荷花瓣上的温柔，敏感肌也能放心使用。速干的材质，当天洗，当天干，满足你爱洁癖的小嗜好！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmTkt6hfuGhVsNwegt-u_V3S6Y-3.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqQygqke98P_bfcraPn_NgRWQOT.jpg"><p><span>有需要的姐妹可以根据下面三种方式，领取专属福利后再购买噢~</span></p><p><span>1.点击可进入专属购买链接</span></p><p><span> 淘宝：</span><a href="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/37909492?shop_id=498131482" data-url="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/37909492?shop_id=498131482"><u><span>mo.m.tmall.com</span></u></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;京东：</span><a href="https://pro.m.jd.com/mall/active/4DMdpdY9zTq19iVSpUxXef26xKxQ/index.html" data-url="https://pro.m.jd.com/mall/active/4DMdpdY9zTq19iVSpUxXef26xKxQ/index.html"><u><span>pro.m.jd.com</span></u></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;2.复制淘口令：39￥jIUgThtHePF￥ / &nbsp;CZ321 到淘宝自动跳转</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;3.淘宝搜索“</span><strong><span>神气小鹿</span></strong><span>”，找到“</span><strong><span>神气小鹿旗舰店</span></strong><span>”向客服报暗号“</span><strong><span>有点案件</span></strong><span>”即可获得专属链接哦</span></p><p><span>⭐</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsEdX0CCN88IsEPBYvxD7EpyVZhU.jpg"><p><span>●&nbsp;</span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 案件开篇-余叔韶的回忆</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> ⭐神气小鹿打广时间⭐</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 手术台上的女尸</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 医生的口供</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 黄煜芳的口供</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> 口供不同之处</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 法庭上的罗轲</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 余叔韶对线黄煜芳</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 黄煜芳的动机</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2952">49:12</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> 伍雅仪</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> 余叔韶的错误</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3365">56:05</a> 结尾</span></p><p><span>⭐</span></p><p><span>●&nbsp;</span><strong><span>本期采用的bgm</span></strong></p><p><span>案件开场：What Is Fight Club - The Dust Brothers </span></p><p><span>广告部分：皇家萌卫-灵空音乐</span></p><p><span>案件插曲：歌女怨-晓露</span></p><p><span>案件背景音：希望的新一天 A New Day with Hope - 陈致逸 </span></p><p><span>案件尾部bgm：一生有意义 - 罗文/甄妮</span></p><p><span>⭐</span></p><p><span>以下为案件信息</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmJV95_a0j-oDK2hkcmKE0ymvXzh.png"><h1><span>● 李纪元为伍雅仪献上花圈</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAsUE5yk9cdwRfwwSWqKTiUTJS7.png"><h1><span>●罗轲被告</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFUyO9oFxyeUQDZGbZ6DMfp7hYe.png"><h1><span>● 法庭上对于罗轲审问的部分</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrI54hBwWXfdn-KLBVnCT3ReyscF.png"><h1><span>●黄煜芳被问部分</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmgDYHjETQXuz1B83PKWXwoGyCkB.png"><h1><span>●伍雅仪</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvO3pxrkay66APInIh-S2CtBcpag.png"><h1><span>●李纪元</span><br><br></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo-RYeWoqZWObfvR8Szaz-tnhgm1.png"><p><span>●余叔韶</span><br><br><span>⭐感谢你的收听，我们下期节目再见~</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Firtj00pNSodaPRFLTRDCuB2yqdt.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
