    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmfbCwEKuxRkoGKe5-aCTwqa_qE.jpg"><p><strong><span>一起盗墓的兄弟，最终走向灭门之灾。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>一段恰似和谐的婚姻，结局却披上了鲜红的寿衣。</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>●&nbsp;你好，这里是有点案件的七宗罪系列「</span><strong><span>愤怒</span></strong><span>」篇 ●&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>作为最常见的情绪之一，愤怒像是每个人情绪当中的修罗场。</span></p><p><span>复仇，憎恨，怨恨，在法律所赋予的权力以外，行使惩罚他人的意欲亦被视作愤怒。</span></p><p><span>现实往往不能给予我们想要的公平，无处安放的愤恨化成怒火燎原。</span></p><p><span>于是我们看见了，被害者和愤怒者共同燃烧的景象。</span></p><p><span>我们会共情，会惋惜，会沉思。</span></p><p><span>或者，也许我们也会感到愤怒。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><em><span>案件时间轴：</span></em></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;开头：我换了新麦啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;校门口的惨案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;第一篇-盗墓兄弟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;寻仇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;血洗两家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;第二篇-如意的相亲对象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;靓丽的寿衣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">49:57</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> &nbsp;●&nbsp;&nbsp;尾声</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><em><span>本期背景音乐：</span></em></p><p><span>丁可 --- 黑夜之城</span></p><p><span>林ゆうき&nbsp;- case</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;Laurel Halo&nbsp;- Belleville</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;岩代太郎 - 갈대밭</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;--------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span>差看更多详情请移至绿色气泡gzh搜「</span><strong><span>有点播客</span></strong><span>」/ 案件资料于7月5号更新</span></p><p><span>感谢你的收听，我们下期节目再见~</span></p><p><span>晚安</span></p><p><span>你不睡我睡</span></p><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><p></p>]]></description>
